[h2]Build 0.9.113[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Further reduced stutters when colonists look for mending work in colonies with a lot of damaged gear, especially with auto-repair set to any damage.
[/list]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]With Dev mode on, an unusually slow search for mending work writes one short line to the log (at most once a minute) saying where the time went, to help track down stutters.
[/list]
